[D Quests for Lower Blackrock Spire \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 57-60 Lower Blackrock Spire]
[NX 58-60 Scholomance]

Lower Blackrock Spire sits high in Blackrock Mountain, between the Searing Gorge and the Burning Steppes. Inside the mountain, follow the upper path up to the ledge with the Blackrock Spire portal; the hanging chain down leads to Blackrock Depths instead.

-- Left out, owned by the Upper Blackrock Spire guide: 4743 Seal of Ascension (the second step of the Upper Blackrock Spire key; 4742 here gathers the gemstones), 4941 Eitrigg's Wisdom and 4974 For The Horde! (the Horde chain after 4903), 5102 General Drakkisath's Demise (after 5089), 4764 to 4766 and 4768/4769 (Rookery and Darkstone Tablet quests), 4734, 4735 and 4907 (Tinkee's egg chain, eggs in the Rookery), 5047, 5127, 5160 and 6569 (listed under Upper Blackrock Spire by the Dungeon Journal).
-- Left out: 5065 The Lost Tablets of Mosh'aru and 4788 The Final Tablets: 4788 needs 5065, whose tablets lie in the Eastern Plaguelands, and both start and end with Prospector Ironboot in Tanaris, far off this road. 5103 Hot Fiery Death and 5306 Snakestone of the Shadow Huntress: Winterspring crafting quests that only take a drop from the Spire. 8966, 8989, 8995 and the rest of the Bodley and Valthalak chain: dungeon-set upgrade chain, level 58 and Alcaz Island based.

-- Horde: Undercity, Kargath, then through the mountain to Flame Crest.
[A Horde] Start in Undercity. At Michael Garrett, get the Undercity flight path [P Undercity] [G63.1,48.3 Undercity]
[A Horde][OC] Leave Undercity and take the road west into Silverpine Forest, then south along it [G56.8,17.2 Undercity][G61.8,65.0 Tirisfal Glades][G49.0,70.0 Tirisfal Glades][G53.0,19.0 Silverpine Forest][G50.5,30.0 Silverpine Forest][G50.0,40.0 Silverpine Forest][G56.0,62.0 Silverpine Forest] \\ Grey elites (Son of Arugal, Old Fire-Eye, Old Vicejaw, 14-25) roam near the road.
[A Horde][OC] East into Hillsbrad and north-east to Tarren Mill. Kirin Tor Guards and Southshore Defenders (level 55) stand by the road south of Tarren Mill, so keep away from them [G15.0,45.0 Hillsbrad Foothills][G35.0,48.0 Hillsbrad Foothills][G55.0,36.0 Hillsbrad Foothills][G60.1,18.6 Hillsbrad Foothills]
[A Horde][OC] Follow the road south-east past Durnholde Keep to the gate in Thoradin's Wall [G58.5,34.0 Hillsbrad Foothills][G62.0,41.0 Hillsbrad Foothills][G83.7,60 Hillsbrad Foothills]
[A Horde][OC] Through the gate and east on the road to the crossing south of Refuge Pointe [G26.3,50.1 Arathi Highlands][G45.2,58.4 Arathi Highlands] \\ Stromgarde Cavalrymen and Lieutenant Valorcall (Alliance elites 36-38) ride near 33,52.
[A Horde][OC] South down the road to Thandol Span [G43.6,73.3 Arathi Highlands][G43.9,83.6 Arathi Highlands][G45.7,98.9 Arathi Highlands] \\ Modr (elite 32) wanders by the bridge.
[A Horde][OC] Cross Thandol Span and follow the road south to Dun Modr [G49.7,26 Wetlands]
[A Horde][OC] South along the river road to Dun Algaz [G57,49.5 Wetlands][G55.1,73.7 Wetlands] \\ Dragonmaw elites and Golm (28-32) stand near 56-58,49-54; Modr and Neru (elite 32) by Dun Modr.
[A Horde][OC] Through the Dun Algaz tunnel into Loch Modan and south on the east road, keeping clear of Thelsamar [G26.3,22.5 Loch Modan][G39.7,43.7 Loch Modan][G43.2,67.8 Loch Modan]
[A Horde][OC] South into the Badlands, then west across the plain to Kargath [G53.5,13.8 Badlands][G50.0,28.5 Badlands][G42,41 Badlands][G18,42 Badlands][G4.0,44.9 Badlands] \\ Shadowforge elites, a War Golem and Broken Tooth (35-40) near 52-54,15-20; a Siege Golem and the Malevolent Mirage (elite 40-42) near 36-40,41.
[A Horde] At Gorrik, get the Kargath flight path [P Kargath] [G4.0,44.9 Badlands] \\ Shadowforge elites, a War Golem and Broken Tooth (35-40) near 52-54,15-20; a Siege Golem and the Malevolent Mirage (elite 40-42) near 36-40,41.
[A Horde] Speak to Warlord Goretooth: [QA98325 Blood and Thunder] [QT98325 Blood and Thunder] [G5.8,47.5 Badlands]
[A Horde] Warlord Goretooth hands you his Command; it starts [QA4903 Warlord's Command] \\ Unverified: QuestieDB has no prerequisite tying 4903 to 98325, so Blood and Thunder may not gate it. [G5.8,47.5 Badlands]
[A Horde] Lexlort gives [QA4981 Operative Bijou] [G5.9,47.6 Badlands]
[A Horde] Galamav the Marksman gives [QA4724 The Pack Mistress] [G6.0,47.7 Badlands]
[A Horde] South out of Kargath and west through the pass into the Searing Gorge [G4.0,44.9 Badlands][G2.0,56.7 Badlands][G80.0,48.2 Searing Gorge] [OC] \\ An Altruist Ward (60) stands near 2,45.
[A Horde] West along the road, then south-west to the Blackrock Mountain gate [G57.8,48.8 Searing Gorge][G47.7,65.9 Searing Gorge][G34.9,83.9 Searing Gorge] [OC] \\ Infernus Siege Giants (level 60) walk the road near 55,53, Lord Gazzran (62) and a Faulty War Golem (rare elite) stand near 45,68, and Obsidian Reavers and Surgers (55-60) guard the gate.
[A Horde] Walk through the mountain and out of the Burning Steppes gate [G15.3,32.4 Burning Steppes] [OC]
[A Horde] South down the road below the mountain, then east along the road and north to Flame Crest [G15.4,40.1 Burning Steppes][G20.7,47.7 Burning Steppes][G21.8,48.8 Burning Steppes][G31.6,51.3 Burning Steppes][G41.2,49.8 Burning Steppes][G46.5,47.7 Burning Steppes][G54.7,40.8 Burning Steppes][G62.9,28.5 Burning Steppes][G65.7,24.2 Burning Steppes] [OC] \\ Flamescale dragonkin (elite, 56-58) stand by the road west of 37,47; the rare elites Terrorspark (51,43) and Thauris Balgarr (54,39) roam near the road, a Blackrock Ambusher (elite 56) waits near 33,51, and Blackrock soldiers, smugglers, Thaurissan agents and War Reavers (53-58) camp along 44-62,30-50; Firesworn (60) wander near 65,24.
[A Horde] At Vahgruk, get the Flame Crest flight path [P Flame Crest] [G65.7,24.2 Burning Steppes]

