[A Alliance] North past Cyrus Therepentous, then west along the north road to Flame Crest [G87.7,62.2 Burning Steppes][G92.1,49.9 Burning Steppes][G95.1,31.6 Burning Steppes][G82.0,30.4 Burning Steppes][G73.8,24.6 Burning Steppes][G65.7,24.2 Burning Steppes] [OC] \\ Black dragonkin (elite) roam the east side; a Malfunctioning Reaver (rare elite) and an Escaped Core Hound (60) wander near 89-91,52-57. Black Dragonspawn, Black Drakes and Black Wyrmkin (elite 50-54) stand by the road near 89-92,50-57, a Frenzied Black Drake (elite 54) near 94,32, and Deathmaw (rare elite 53) roams near 82,30 and Fel Interlopers (55-58) near 69,26. Flame Crest is a Horde camp: its guards attack you, and Firesworn (60) wander near 65,24.

-- Both factions: Flame Crest.
Kibler gives [QA4729 Kibler's Exotic Pets] and [QA4862 En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why] [G65.9,21.9 Burning Steppes]
Ragged John gives [QA4866 Mother's Milk] [G65.0,23.8 Burning Steppes]
South-west to the road and west to the foot of Blackrock Mountain [G65.7,24.2 Burning Steppes][G62.9,28.5 Burning Steppes][G54.7,40.8 Burning Steppes][G46.5,47.7 Burning Steppes][G41.2,49.8 Burning Steppes][G31.6,51.3 Burning Steppes][G21.8,48.8 Burning Steppes][G20.7,47.7 Burning Steppes][G15.4,40.1 Burning Steppes] [OC] \\ Flamescale dragonkin (elite, 56-58) stand by the road west of 37,47 and Blackrock Ambushers (elite 56) near 33,51; the rare elites Terrorspark and Thauris Balgarr roam near 51-54,39-43; Greater Obsidian Elementals, smugglers and War Reavers (53-58) stand along 54-62,30-41.
North up into the mountain's Burning Steppes gate [G15.3,32.4 Burning Steppes] [OC]
Gruklash (rare elite 59) can stand by the gate near 15,30. Inside the mountain, take the upper path up to the ledge and the Blackrock Spire portal. Do not ride the hanging chain down; it goes to Blackrock Depths.

-- Lower Blackrock Spire
Enter Lower Blackrock Spire. Do these on the way:
Speak to the Scarshield Infiltrator near the start: [QA4742 Seal of Ascension] \\ Needs level 57. You need an Unadorned Seal of Ascension (random drop from Spire mobs) and the gemstones of Highlord Omokk, War Master Voone and Overlord Wyrmthalak.
[A Horde] Find Bijou in her hiding spot past the first bridges: [QT4981 Operative Bijou] [QA4982 Bijou's Belongings]
[A Alliance] Find Bijou in her hiding spot past the first bridges: [QA5001 Bijou's Belongings]
[A Horde] [O] Find Bijou's Belongings on the lower floor [QC4982 Bijou's Belongings]
[A Alliance] [O] Find Bijou's Belongings on the lower floor [QC5001 Bijou's Belongings]
[A Horde] Back to Bijou: [QT4982 Bijou's Belongings] [QA4983 Bijou's Reconnaissance Report]
[A Alliance] Back to Bijou: [QT5001 Bijou's Belongings] [QA5002 Message to Maxwell]
Kill Highlord Omokk and keep his head; take a Roughshod Pike from the weapon rack nearby.
Warosh, a troll ghost past the spider tunnels, gives [QA4867 Urok Doomhowl] \\ Put Omokk's Head and the Roughshod Pike on Urok's Tribute Pile; Urok and his ogre waves come, and his Mojo drops.
[QC4867 Urok Doomhowl] Warosh takes [QT4867 Urok Doomhowl]
[O] Gather 15 Spire Spider Eggs from the egg sacs in the spider tunnels [QC4862 En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why]
[O] Kill Highlord Omokk, War Master Voone and Overlord Wyrmthalak for their gemstones [QC4742,1][QC4742,2][QC4742,3]
[O] Loot an Unadorned Seal of Ascension from Spire mobs [QC4742,4]
[A Horde] [O] Kill the three generals [QC4903,1][QC4903,2][QC4903,3]
[A Horde] [O] Take the Important Blackrock Documents beside one of them [QC4903,4]
[A Alliance] Overlord Wyrmthalak drops General Drakkisath's Command; it starts [QA5089 General Drakkisath's Command]
Kill Halycon in the worg den [QC4701 Put Her Down][QC4724 The Pack Mistress] \\ Gizrul the Slavener comes for you right after.
In the worg den, use Kibler's cage on a Bloodaxe Worg Pup [QC4729 Kibler's Exotic Pets]
Back to the Scarshield Infiltrator with the seal and gemstones: [QT4742 Seal of Ascension] \\ The next step, 4743, is in the Upper Blackrock Spire guide.
Last, kill Mother Smolderweb in the spider area and let her Mother's Milk poison stay on you; nobody may cleanse it.

